 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The mass in kilograms of Luxembourg's imports from non-EU27 partners decreased from 430.6 million kg in 2005 to 171.2 million kg in 2025.",
  "The imports peaked at 607.4 million kg in 2006, which was the largest change between consecutive years from 2005 to 2006.",
  "The two largest import periods, 2006 and 2007, accounted for 19.3% of the total imports over 2005 to 2025.",
  "The median import mass over the entire period was 235.4 million kg, with imports in 2024 at 165.7 million kg, close to the 2025 value.",
  "The data only includes trade rows with known quantities, so volumes and unit values may not represent all trade."
 ],
